          <h1 id="hm-title" data-fx="wipe">Hematology Treatment in <span class="grad-text">Bangalore</span></h1>
          <p class="phero__sub" data-fx="fade" style="--d:.15s">Hematology is the branch of medicine that diagnoses and treats diseases of the blood, bone marrow and lymph nodes: anemia, bleeding and clotting problems, low or high blood counts, inherited conditions like thalassemia, and blood cancers. Many blood disorders can be cured or well controlled when they are found early.</p>
